WEBVTT

00:01.680 --> 00:03.740
Now listen, Akemitsu.

00:03.740 --> 00:06.720
No one can live alone.

00:06.720 --> 00:08.860
Where'd that come from, Dad?

00:09.200 --> 00:12.830
As a member of the Akagami family, 
you should understand.

00:12.830 --> 00:16.070
Two is better than one, 
and many is better than two.

00:16.070 --> 00:18.260
Doesn't having more friends make you happier?

00:18.710 --> 00:19.790
Yeah!

00:19.790 --> 00:25.950
So your dad thought, "Surely it's 
better to have more lovers, too."

00:25.950 --> 00:27.790
You're so cool, Dad!

00:29.460 --> 00:31.800
Looks like my ride is here.

00:33.220 --> 00:36.030
Are you going somewhere, Dad?

00:36.030 --> 00:40.600
Yes. Your dad has decided 
to live his own life...

00:42.200 --> 00:46.560
by getting <i>real</i> friendly with all the 
women of the world he hasn't met yet.

00:46.560 --> 00:51.000
You're so cool, Dad! The coolest!

00:51.000 --> 00:53.030
Dad!

02:23.910 --> 02:28.750
<b>Episode 1: You'll Repay Us With Your Body!</b>

02:40.080 --> 02:41.370
Poke, poke.

02:51.630 --> 02:53.670
Hilarious.

03:03.410 --> 03:05.120
I have to get to class!

03:08.410 --> 03:10.620
<i>My father once said to me,</i>

03:11.280 --> 03:14.550
<i>"No one can live alone."</i>

03:18.630 --> 03:20.510
Last two laps!

03:20.510 --> 03:21.960
Sure is nice.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.210
Sure is.

03:23.210 --> 03:24.860
That sure is a nice ass.

03:24.860 --> 03:26.600
Sure is.

03:26.600 --> 03:27.790
Hey, Akagami.

03:27.790 --> 03:29.520
Check it out.

03:29.920 --> 03:31.560
Sorry, but I've got work.

03:32.320 --> 03:35.130
Akagami never changes.

03:35.130 --> 03:37.400
Hey, wanna go to a mixer?

03:39.720 --> 03:41.030
I'll pass.

03:41.030 --> 03:43.660
<b>Civil Service Exam
Study Guide</b>

03:41.030 --> 03:43.680
<i>No need, no need, no need!</i>

03:43.680 --> 03:47.800
<i>The life of Akagami Akemitsu needs no women!</i>

03:51.400 --> 03:52.900
Thank you.

03:53.670 --> 03:57.880
Thanks for picking up this shift 
on such short notice, Akagami-kun.

03:57.880 --> 03:59.420
No problem, boss.

03:59.420 --> 04:01.560
Are you sure you're okay staying this late?

04:01.560 --> 04:04.810
I figured a college student would have 
a date planned or something.

04:04.810 --> 04:07.430
Oh, I'm going to be single for life.

04:07.430 --> 04:11.470
Are you? By the time your father was your age—

04:11.470 --> 04:14.150
I'm not like my father.

04:14.940 --> 04:17.590
S-Sorry...

04:17.590 --> 04:18.940
Welcome.

04:27.350 --> 04:29.990
You're so cool, Dad!

04:32.410 --> 04:37.830
<i>There's no way that perverted scumbag 
was cool, five-year-old me.</i>

04:39.520 --> 04:43.880
<i>I've suffered so much 
embarrassment because of that jerk.</i>

04:44.200 --> 04:47.890
Akagami Akemitsu? Oh, my! From <i>that</i> family?

04:48.270 --> 04:52.410
No! He's an Akagami! He'll violate us!

04:53.290 --> 04:56.500
<i>I shall wipe away this dishonor.</i>

04:56.500 --> 04:58.280
<i>Mixers? Girlfriends?</i>

04:57.150 --> 04:57.440
Mixers

04:57.440 --> 05:00.400
Mixers

04:57.650 --> 04:57.940
Girlfriends

04:57.940 --> 05:00.400
Girlfriends

04:58.280 --> 05:00.510
<i>Those are just evils, nothing more.</i>

05:00.510 --> 05:02.900
<i>I'll live a noble single life.</i>

05:03.900 --> 05:09.200
<i>I'll pass the civil service exam and 
acquire a stable income and status.</i>

05:03.900 --> 05:09.200
<b>Civil Service Exam
Study Guide</b>

05:09.200 --> 05:12.910
<i>And then... And then...</i>

05:10.200 --> 05:12.910
<b>Civil Service Exam
Study Guide</b>

05:10.990 --> 05:12.910
Guaranteed Success Series Study Guide

05:13.930 --> 05:16.950
Wait!

05:25.880 --> 05:27.640
Where'd this bale of rice come from?

05:27.640 --> 05:29.430
I'm so sorry!

05:35.040 --> 05:37.690
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

05:39.940 --> 05:43.820
I'm really sorry. The cart tipped over.

05:44.420 --> 05:47.450
Um, can you stand?

05:47.790 --> 05:49.860
Are you in any pain?

05:50.450 --> 05:53.950
What should I do? 
I guess I should call an ambulance.

05:55.380 --> 05:56.960
There's no problem.

05:56.960 --> 05:59.260
I'm totally fine.

05:59.260 --> 06:00.830
Wait!

06:01.210 --> 06:03.660
<i>Crap, crap, crap!</i>

06:03.660 --> 06:05.600
<i>This can't be real! No way!</i>

06:05.600 --> 06:09.770
<i>This can't happen! Not to me!</i>

06:22.080 --> 06:23.660
<i>She's cute...</i>

06:30.480 --> 06:32.320
Last lap!

06:32.320 --> 06:35.020
Should we enjoy the view again today?

06:35.020 --> 06:36.550
Sounds good.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.960
Huh? Akagami?

06:41.960 --> 06:43.340
So sexy...

06:44.100 --> 06:46.670
We're gonna go to another mixer.

06:46.670 --> 06:49.340
You're not coming, right?

06:52.210 --> 06:53.350
I'll go.

06:53.350 --> 06:55.260
Seriously?! What about your lectures?

06:55.260 --> 06:56.320
I'll skip.

06:56.320 --> 06:56.890
And your job?

06:56.890 --> 06:58.580
I'll skip.

06:59.980 --> 07:01.880
Cheers!

07:05.340 --> 07:08.530
<i>What am I doing?!</i>

07:08.810 --> 07:10.920
<i>I can't believe I fell in love at first sight!</i>

07:10.920 --> 07:12.970
<i>Not only do my feelings grow day by day,</i>

07:12.970 --> 07:15.780
<i>but I'm assaulted by waves of desire 
like water breaking through a dam!</i>

07:16.090 --> 07:18.600
<i>I even ended up getting fired from my job!</i>

07:18.290 --> 07:19.290
<b>Fired
for
skipping
work</b>

07:18.290 --> 07:19.290
m 0 0 l 65 0 l 65 100 l 0 100

07:18.600 --> 07:22.190
<i>I'm about to fail my classes, too!</i>

07:21.790 --> 07:22.670
m 0 0 l 65 0 l 65 100 l 0 100

07:21.790 --> 07:22.670
<b>Failing
for
skipping
class</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:26.170
<i>So this is the curse of the Akagami family?!</i>

07:26.170 --> 07:27.670
m 0 0 l 65 0 l 65 100 l 0 100

07:26.170 --> 07:27.670
<b>Not
a
curse</b>

07:27.670 --> 07:29.420
Incoming
Call

07:29.870 --> 07:33.740
Hello? A mixer? Yeah, I'll be there.

07:33.740 --> 07:35.400
Wait, no!

07:35.660 --> 07:39.180
There's only one option left.

07:39.890 --> 07:41.640
<b>Registrar</b>

07:41.640 --> 07:42.750
<b>Leave of Absence</b>

07:44.840 --> 07:46.020
Are you serious?

07:46.360 --> 07:47.540
Yes.

07:48.030 --> 07:52.030
<i>You're renouncing the world to become a monk?
Do you have connections to a temple?</i>

07:52.030 --> 07:56.030
<i>When I discussed the idea with my uncle, 
who's a former priest, he lent me a stole.</i>

07:56.030 --> 08:00.520
<i>I feel like there are other ways 
to overcome your desires.</i>

08:00.520 --> 08:04.660
<i>Distancing yourself from the secular world 
is the best way to retrain yourself.</i>

08:03.290 --> 08:06.290
Mikazuki
Temple

08:06.290 --> 08:08.880
Mikazuki Temple

08:08.080 --> 08:09.340
<i>This is it.</i>

08:10.300 --> 08:15.260
<i>I'll become a monk at this temple my uncle 
referred me to, one closed off to women.</i>

08:17.440 --> 08:20.310
<i>Now I won't be led astray.</i>

08:23.970 --> 08:25.810
Pardon me!

08:27.750 --> 08:30.270
Pardon me!

08:30.270 --> 08:31.820
Yes?

08:36.720 --> 08:38.370
Can I help you?

08:39.060 --> 08:39.960
Huh?

08:41.810 --> 08:44.210
Um, excuse me...

08:44.890 --> 08:47.710
What kind of prank is this?!

08:49.670 --> 08:52.780
A stole? Wait, no way...

08:56.220 --> 08:58.180
One moment, please!

08:59.110 --> 09:01.220
<i>What's she doing here?</i>

09:02.040 --> 09:04.580
<i>I thought women weren't allowed here.</i>

09:04.580 --> 09:07.200
<i>Is she an illusion produced by my desires?</i>

09:07.200 --> 09:08.810
Thank you for waiting.

09:10.230 --> 09:12.440
Ouch...

09:14.640 --> 09:18.410
Excuse me. I was in a hurry.

09:19.550 --> 09:25.250
SPARKLE

09:19.550 --> 09:25.250
SPARKLE

09:19.550 --> 09:25.250
SPARKLE

09:19.550 --> 09:25.250
SPARKLE

09:20.120 --> 09:22.330
Thank you for coming all this way.

09:22.870 --> 09:25.250
My name is Aoba Yuzuki.

09:27.800 --> 09:29.500
Um, where are you going?

09:36.380 --> 09:38.430
Are you all right?

09:41.440 --> 09:42.430
Huh?

09:43.930 --> 09:46.160
<i>No, no! Anything but that!</i>

09:46.160 --> 09:48.940
<i>I'm in no condition to resist right now!</i>

09:48.940 --> 09:51.540
I-I'm sorry. My clothes...

09:50.530 --> 09:53.480
<i>Don't look! I must leave here right away!</i>

09:53.480 --> 09:56.450
<i>Right away... I must... I...</i>

09:57.920 --> 10:00.890
I love you! Please marry me!

10:03.410 --> 10:04.520
What?

10:06.330 --> 10:10.000
<b>Life has its ups and downs.</b>

10:14.150 --> 10:15.490
Here you are.

10:15.490 --> 10:16.630
Thank you.

10:24.090 --> 10:25.890
<i>What's going on here?</i>

10:26.270 --> 10:27.600
<i>Why are we having tea?</i>

10:27.600 --> 10:30.900
<i>I thought joining a temple 
would look more like...</i>

10:31.230 --> 10:32.540
Please let me join the temple!

10:32.540 --> 10:33.900
Get out of here!

10:33.900 --> 10:37.720
I'm sorry. The head priest 
isn't here right now.

10:37.720 --> 10:38.960
I see.

10:38.960 --> 10:42.410
I was told you'd be coming tomorrow.

10:42.410 --> 10:45.660
<i>I see. So there was a 
miscommunication with my uncle.</i>

10:44.790 --> 10:45.660
Uncle

10:45.660 --> 10:48.240
So, um...

10:48.240 --> 10:51.670
<i>Either way, what's she doing here?</i>

10:52.320 --> 10:53.670
What are your interests?

10:53.670 --> 10:54.670
<i>A question?</i>

10:55.200 --> 10:57.980
<i>Is this an admission test?</i>

10:55.630 --> 11:02.680
Pass or Fail

10:57.980 --> 11:02.680
<i>Did they invite a woman to a place where 
women are prohibited to gauge my reaction?</i>

11:02.960 --> 11:05.050
<i>This is bad. Really bad.</i>

11:05.050 --> 11:07.080
<i>I proposed to her seconds 
after arriving at the temple.</i>

11:07.080 --> 11:09.780
<i>I'm surely going to fail.</i>

11:11.600 --> 11:13.730
I-Is something wrong?

11:14.040 --> 11:15.860
<i>She's so cute.</i>

11:17.490 --> 11:19.110
What are you doing?!

11:19.110 --> 11:22.700
Forgive me, but I'm experiencing 
some worldly desires.

11:22.700 --> 11:24.040
Where is your restroom?

11:24.040 --> 11:27.120
It's out the door and to the left.

11:30.170 --> 11:32.870
<i>Crap, crap, crap. What should I do?</i>

11:35.740 --> 11:37.700
<i>What a magnificent yard.</i>

11:42.950 --> 11:44.260
<i>Is it down there?</i>

11:46.550 --> 11:48.540
Are you stuck down there?

11:52.100 --> 11:54.060
It's too deep to reach.

12:03.700 --> 12:05.500
Hello, Kiki-san?

12:05.500 --> 12:09.370
What's the matter? 
Well, the man I'm supposed to meet

12:09.370 --> 12:11.710
arrived a day early for some reason.

12:12.000 --> 12:14.840
This is my first arranged marriage meeting.

12:14.840 --> 12:18.080
He actually asked me to marry 
him as soon as he got here.

12:18.080 --> 12:20.000
You're supposed to be the intermediary, right?

12:20.000 --> 12:22.090
Get back here and help me.

12:22.090 --> 12:25.220
Hang on. What are you talking about?

12:25.520 --> 12:29.720
<i>The man you're supposed to meet 
is sitting next to me right now.</i>

12:30.200 --> 12:33.700
What? Then who is he?

12:33.700 --> 12:36.260
<i>Yuzuki, hello? Yuzuki?</i>

12:36.710 --> 12:38.390
I'm back.

12:38.980 --> 12:40.120
Tsukuyo.

12:40.120 --> 12:43.520
Yuzu-nee, was your arranged 
marriage meeting today?

12:43.520 --> 12:45.860
I was hoping to spy on you.

12:46.220 --> 12:48.010
A malevolent ghost appeared.

12:48.010 --> 12:49.120
What?

12:49.500 --> 12:51.900
Or perhaps he's a type of spirit.

12:52.660 --> 12:56.540
What are you talking about? Those don't... exist...

12:57.130 --> 13:01.510
Help me...

13:07.840 --> 13:09.380
Tsukuyo, run!

13:12.640 --> 13:16.270
An ambulance...

13:23.720 --> 13:26.790
Ghost, begone!

13:28.660 --> 13:29.880
This way!

13:33.660 --> 13:35.900
Wh-Wh-Wh-What is that thing?!

13:35.900 --> 13:38.420
I told you! That's the malevolent ghost!

13:40.370 --> 13:43.760
No! You've got the wrong idea!

13:43.760 --> 13:45.290
Where have you been?

13:47.440 --> 13:48.930
Oh, Onee-cha—

13:48.930 --> 13:50.960
Kurage!

13:50.010 --> 13:51.680
Run!

14:06.890 --> 14:08.510
Kagura, my brush.

14:08.510 --> 14:10.070
Yes, Mia-san.

14:12.580 --> 14:15.080
Mia-san, what is this?

14:15.080 --> 14:24.090
<b>Nozawa Masako</b>

14:15.400 --> 14:17.950
It's read "Yamato nadeshiko."

14:17.950 --> 14:21.400
It's a title granted to true 
gentlewomen who live stalwartly

14:21.400 --> 14:24.090
in the tumultuous industry of voice acting.

14:24.090 --> 14:25.840
Oh...

14:25.840 --> 14:28.180
We should strive to be like her.

14:29.920 --> 14:31.800
What's all this noise?

14:37.640 --> 14:39.940
Wh-What's going o—

14:43.960 --> 14:45.640
Who is this guy?!

14:44.930 --> 14:46.660
Oh, my.

14:45.640 --> 14:48.510
Move! Get off of me!

14:47.140 --> 14:50.140
I must resolve this misunderstanding...

14:48.510 --> 14:50.910
Kagura, don't just watch! Help me!

14:50.910 --> 14:52.650
Hilarious.

14:52.650 --> 14:55.290
This is hardly a laughing matter!

14:56.760 --> 14:58.920
Was that Mia's voice?

14:58.920 --> 15:02.290
What should we do? 
The ghost is claiming more victims.

15:02.810 --> 15:04.920
And we left Kurage behind!

15:04.920 --> 15:07.340
It seemed to ignore Kurage.

15:07.340 --> 15:10.330
Then why is it coming after us?

15:10.760 --> 15:13.140
What makes us different from Kurage?

15:13.140 --> 15:14.780
Different?

15:15.510 --> 15:17.740
That ghost is a total perv!

15:25.750 --> 15:30.280
<i>If he was a real ghost, that drop kick 
would've passed right through him.</i>

15:30.590 --> 15:34.300
<i>I'm sure they'll understand 
once I talk to them.</i>

15:46.240 --> 15:48.870
No, wait. I...

15:50.810 --> 15:54.580
<i>She really is cute, damn it.</i>

15:57.010 --> 15:59.020
Mikazuki Temple

16:00.930 --> 16:03.400
A pervert? Now that's just perfect.

16:04.070 --> 16:08.400
So he was under the impression that this place 
was the temple his uncle referred him to.

16:08.400 --> 16:10.830
And when you saw his stole,

16:10.830 --> 16:15.280
you thought the monk you were supposed 
to meet came a day early.

16:15.280 --> 16:16.570
Yes.

16:16.890 --> 16:19.800
Now who's responsible for this?

16:19.800 --> 16:23.960
<i>You</i> forgot to tell me someone 
was coming to the temple.

16:24.760 --> 16:27.600
And <i>you</i> mistook him for 
the man you're meeting.

16:27.600 --> 16:31.970
I didn't think I'd need to look at his photo!

16:31.970 --> 16:33.970
His uncle's partially to blame, too.

16:33.970 --> 16:35.680
<b>No Men Allowed</b>

16:33.970 --> 16:38.970
He told his nephew to come here without 
realizing it'd been converted to a nunnery.

16:39.540 --> 16:41.980
A nunnery?

16:41.980 --> 16:44.360
I-I know it was a misunderstanding,

16:44.360 --> 16:48.910
but I'm truly sorry about the 
drop kick and palm heel strike!

16:48.910 --> 16:50.480
Don't worry about that.

16:51.330 --> 16:53.690
Who are these people?

16:54.510 --> 16:56.830
Well, you know, even if it was an accident,

16:56.830 --> 16:59.620
there are some things a lady should never do.

16:59.620 --> 17:01.620
Okay, why don't we do this?

17:01.920 --> 17:07.800
We'll agree you're both at fault, 
and he'll train here as a monk for a while.

17:07.800 --> 17:09.130
What?!

17:09.130 --> 17:11.080
Are you serious, Kiki-san?

17:11.080 --> 17:13.090
This is a nunnery.

17:13.090 --> 17:15.820
Just take down the sign 
that says men aren't allowed.

17:15.820 --> 17:17.470
Just like that?

17:17.470 --> 17:24.230
Are you saying you don't want 
a man around for free labor?

17:27.230 --> 17:28.510
B-But...

17:28.510 --> 17:30.250
I want to take it easy.

17:30.250 --> 17:32.430
I'm sure you do, but...

17:32.430 --> 17:34.750
Don't fight it, you two.

17:35.630 --> 17:38.240
<i>Huh? Are things starting to go my way?</i>

17:38.240 --> 17:40.600
You expect us to live with this man?

17:40.600 --> 17:42.240
Put that away.

17:42.240 --> 17:44.620
You're in danger, too, Kiki-san!

17:44.620 --> 17:46.700
He's boob-obsessed!

17:46.700 --> 17:48.560
Oh? Let's see.

17:49.000 --> 17:51.170
Don't test him!

17:51.170 --> 17:53.520
Do you know what he said to me?!

17:53.520 --> 17:58.990
H-He said he lo... loves... loaaah!

17:59.490 --> 18:00.890
Loah?

18:00.890 --> 18:04.390
Um... I appreciate the offer, but...

18:07.360 --> 18:09.310
Are you sure?

18:09.310 --> 18:12.070
Yes. I wouldn't want to cause any more trouble.

18:12.070 --> 18:13.290
Besides...

18:16.470 --> 18:20.660
<i>I doubt she remembers our first meeting.</i>

18:22.340 --> 18:23.530
Goodbye.

18:30.320 --> 18:31.740
Yuzuki-oneechan.

18:32.650 --> 18:34.980
Nyagosuke says it's too bad.

18:36.170 --> 18:38.890
I don't think he's a bad person.

18:40.920 --> 18:42.330
Maybe you're right.

18:44.310 --> 18:46.010
I missed the last one.

18:48.870 --> 18:51.020
What am I doing?

18:52.280 --> 18:54.120
What am I going to do now?

18:55.300 --> 18:57.570
Really, what <i>are</i> you going to do?

19:02.800 --> 19:04.700
I knew it.

19:05.100 --> 19:10.230
This place is way out in the country, 
so the buses stop running early.

19:13.570 --> 19:15.670
I-Is there something else you need?

19:19.000 --> 19:21.800
Why don't you stay the night?

19:22.680 --> 19:23.660
What?

19:24.430 --> 19:28.940
I mean, we both made mistakes 
that caused trouble for each other,

19:28.940 --> 19:31.690
and our place has a lot of space, 
given that it's a temple.

19:32.030 --> 19:34.560
You still can't live here, though.

19:35.540 --> 19:38.440
I'll convince the others, okay?

19:39.590 --> 19:42.950
<i>At least I'm a good judge of character.</i>

19:43.980 --> 19:45.580
Thank you.

19:45.980 --> 19:50.580
But I'll do what I can on my own for a bit longer.

19:50.960 --> 19:52.480
I see.

19:52.480 --> 19:56.170
<i>I don't want her to become 
a reason for me to run away.</i>

19:56.590 --> 20:00.440
Anyway, I was so surprised today.

20:00.440 --> 20:02.300
How could you say that as soon as we met?

20:02.300 --> 20:04.680
I'm sorry. I hope you can forget about that.

20:04.680 --> 20:09.010
Forget? That's awful in its own way, too.

20:09.010 --> 20:10.520
Sorry.

20:10.860 --> 20:13.770
We've only met twice, and you're 
already asking me to marry you.

20:14.900 --> 20:16.770
<i>She remembered.</i>

20:17.100 --> 20:20.520
What kind of joke is that?

20:24.160 --> 20:25.030
Huh?

20:26.160 --> 20:30.120
Wait... You <i>were</i> joking, right?

20:31.870 --> 20:32.970
Um...

20:32.970 --> 20:34.310
Y-Yes?

20:34.840 --> 20:35.910
My name...

20:36.690 --> 20:37.720
Your name?

20:38.760 --> 20:42.380
My name is Akagami Akemitsu.

20:42.720 --> 20:45.260
Oh, right. I hadn't gotten your name yet.

20:46.710 --> 20:49.640
We're really rushing through things, aren't we?

20:57.160 --> 21:00.400
Nice to meet you. I'm Aoba Yuzuki.

21:02.580 --> 21:05.410
Nice to meet you.

21:06.280 --> 21:08.860
Wait... Akagami?

21:09.410 --> 21:13.030
Not... <i>that</i> Akagami?

21:13.910 --> 21:15.670
Mikazuki
Temple

21:15.670 --> 21:19.040
I promise I'll do everything in my power

21:19.040 --> 21:22.420
to repay the 20 million yen 
my father owes you!

21:22.420 --> 21:25.310
I'm terribly sorry!

21:25.310 --> 21:27.550
Okay, okay. Down, girl.

21:28.060 --> 21:29.500
I can't believe he's the son of the guy

21:29.500 --> 21:33.470
who borrowed money from 
our temple and disappeared!

21:34.040 --> 21:35.850
Listen, everyone.

21:35.940 --> 21:41.860
<b>Slave</b>

21:36.140 --> 21:39.210
He can't possibly repay that amount right away,

21:39.210 --> 21:41.860
but we can't just let him off the hook.

21:42.130 --> 21:44.860
Slave Trade | Organ Trade

21:42.370 --> 21:45.070
So let's come up with a humane 
way for him to repay us.

21:44.860 --> 21:49.120
Slave Trade | Organ Trade

21:45.070 --> 21:47.200
Raise your hands to vote.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.160
Slave trade.

21:48.160 --> 21:49.120
Organ trade.

21:49.120 --> 21:53.480
Wouldn't it be best to sell his dignity?

21:54.120 --> 21:56.110
I bet he'd be able to work 
for a long, long time.

21:56.110 --> 21:58.120
Kurage, what are you talking about?

21:58.120 --> 22:00.880
In any case, after much thought,

22:00.880 --> 22:04.970
we've decided you'll repay us with your body.

22:05.470 --> 22:06.510
What?

22:08.860 --> 22:10.010
What?!

23:44.980 --> 24:00.000
<b>Next Time</b>

23:44.980 --> 24:00.000
<b>Being Pervy Isn't a Bad Thing</b>

23:46.400 --> 23:48.240
Begin by removing your clothes.

23:48.240 --> 23:49.050
Why?

23:49.050 --> 23:50.680
Akagami-san will remove his clothes, too.

23:50.680 --> 23:52.060
Why?

23:52.060 --> 23:53.610
It'll go in once it's wet.

23:53.610 --> 23:55.850
Why?!

23:55.850 --> 23:59.130
Being pervy isn't a bad thing.
